        <mxCell id="IAxuHkiqCEh5J0P0mutU-199" edge="1" parent="1" source="IAxuHkiqCEh5J0P0mutU-181" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;endArrow=none;endFill=0;startArrow=ERoneToMany;startFill=0;" target="IAxuHkiqCEh5J0P0mutU-106">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IAxuHkiqCEh5J0P0mutU-203" edge="1" parent="1" source="IAxuHkiqCEh5J0P0mutU-184" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;endArrow=none;endFill=0;startArrow=ERoneToMany;startFill=0;" target="IAxuHkiqCEh5J0P0mutU-2">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="730.06" y="145" />
              <mxPoint x="730.06" y="340.06" />
              <mxPoint x="250.06" y="340.06" />
              <mxPoint x="250.06" y="85" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IAxuHkiqCEh5J0P0mutU-204" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=18;" value="Business logic:&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Mentor (User) assigns Student (User) an assignment. Fac&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ulty also assigns two C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ommittee Members (User) to the assignment. The Assignment is given a subject, and can be associated with a validation schema, specified in a separate file.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Student submits a Submission, which the backend automatically validates against the validation schema, if provided. The validation backend writes the validation report output to a machine-readable file whose URL is stored in the DB. A frontend reads it to give the student and reviewers a human-readable view. After validation, the Submission is made available for Review by the Mentor (review_status = Pending).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;- After validation, the Mentor submits a Review of the Submission, flagging it as approved or denied, and can attach notes.&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;- After Mentor review, Committee Members submit Reviews as well with the same process as the mentor.&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;- After all three faculty members submit their review, the Mentor will flag the assignment with a final review status (Approved / Denied). Depending on the review status, the student might have to submit a new Submission.&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="450" width="770" x="80" y="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
